  <item>
    <title>38.为什么我们看不到第三个选项？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a880d4bef65145dfcc3201c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a880d4bef65145dfcc3201c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 08:42:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，我是园长，今天想聊一个最近被频繁问到的关于“亲密关系”的问题。</span></p><p><span>✍️ shownotes</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 人到底需不需要亲密关系？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 一旦认定亲密关系重要，这件事就容易……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">05:36</a> 连跟AI谈感情都紧张，你到底在害怕什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> 觉得亲密关系不重要，这件事就容易……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 为什么你总想证明：我是被爱的、值得被爱的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="773">12:53</a> 出离心不是劝你远离关系，这可能是对佛法最大的误读</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 佛法给出的亲密关系的第三个选项</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="871">14:31</a> 亲密关系真正重要的地方：它可能逼你看清、认识自我</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 你不明白这个人他喜欢的是你还是你的外表</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1599">26:39</a> 中道不是折中，而是看见两个极端都出了问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2442">40:42</a> 修“色、受、想、行、识”，这个不能帮你解脱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2682">44:42</a> 如何了解自己，这件事没有标准答案</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2789">46:29</a> 了解自己是你这辈子的课题主线</span></p><p><span>🎵本期BGM：</span></p><p><span>Music by&nbsp;</span><a href="https://pixabay.com/users/leberch-42823964/?utm_source=link-attribution&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=music&amp;utm_content=525211" data-url="https://pixabay.com/users/leberch-42823964/?utm_source=link-attribution&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=music&amp;utm_content=525211"><span>Nikita Kondrashev</span></a><span>&nbsp;from&nbsp;</span><a href="https://pixabay.com//?utm_source=link-attribution&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=music&amp;utm_content=525211" data-url="https://pixabay.com//?utm_source=link-attribution&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=music&amp;utm_content=525211"><span>Pixabay</span></a></p><p><span>👋后期：</span></p><p><span>制作：文清</span></p><p><span>👨在哪里还可以看到主播</span></p><p><span>公众号：园长的多重宇宙</span></p><p><span>📹本节目在哪可听：</span></p><p><span>苹果播客｜小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜spotify</span></p>]]></description>
