  <item>
    <title>37.佛法的精华是匪气</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a7ed64017676351c571dad2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a7ed64017676351c571dad2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 09:31:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，我是园长，今天和大家聊一下匪气。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 什么是匪气？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="378">06:18</a> 大家认为烦恼和痛苦是从哪来的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">06:34</a> 第一种，你认为所有问题都是来自外部的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="496">08:16</a> 第二种观点带来的解决方案有一种宿命论的感觉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="784">13:04</a> 第三种，认为问题出在内部，因此解决方案也在内部</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> 第四种观点正式进入大乘的范围，认为这一切来自于见地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1106">18:26</a> 第五种，痛苦和见地都是凭空捏造的，你是本自具足的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a> 第三第四类我们称为因乘，第五类我们称为果乘（佛乘）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1184">19:44</a> 因乘是什么意思呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> 佛乘是什么意思呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 当园长跟你说做好自己的时候，意思就是让你放松，就是让你不要做任何事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">31:32</a> 匪气最重要的是两头放下</span></p><p><span>🎵本期BGM：</span></p><p><span>Music by </span><a href="https://pixabay.com/users/leberch-42823964/?utm_source=link-attribution&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=music&amp;utm_content=525211" data-url="https://pixabay.com/users/leberch-42823964/?utm_source=link-attribution&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=music&amp;utm_content=525211"><u><span>Nikita Kondrashev</span></u></a><span> from </span><a href="https://pixabay.com//?utm_source=link-attribution&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=music&amp;utm_content=525211" data-url="https://pixabay.com//?utm_source=link-attribution&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=music&amp;utm_content=525211"><u><span>Pixabay</span></u></a></p><p><span>👋后期：</span></p><p><span>制作：文清</span></p><p><span>👨在哪里还可以看到主播</span></p><p><span>公众号：园长的多重宇宙</span></p><p><span>📹本节目在哪可听：</span></p><p><span>苹果播客｜小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜spotify</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
