  <item>
    <title>32.打坐如何不紧张？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a1021f7e59ebca9361f4a96</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a1021f7e59ebca9361f4a96</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 09:34:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，我是园长。</span></p><p><span>一直都有朋友想让我聊聊打坐，这期就和你们聊聊打坐如何不紧张，这应该是被问的最多的。</span></p><p><span>这期的文字版在我的公众号上「园长的多重宇宙」发过👉</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rs3iECRW4zwHhvxCV-jLug" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rs3iECRW4zwHhvxCV-jLug"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><p><span>文中提到的「发呆禅」，详情文字看👉</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Gdi1E6HXY9kuyTgFOznUTQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Gdi1E6HXY9kuyTgFOznUTQ"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><p><span>✍️ shownotes</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a> 打坐放松不了，问题根本不在腿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">03:36</a> 一旦开始衡量禅修，你就已经紧了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a> 闭关也可能只是“高级版焦虑”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="594">09:54</a> 现代人想放松，条件居然苛刻成这样</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">10:16</a> 躺三天、发呆三天，也可能是修行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">12:31</a> 一个禅修好办法——“发呆禅”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> 另一答案：我要把全世界人的紧张给吸过来，让我更紧张？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1012">16:52</a> 那个能觉知焦虑的“你”，才是真正关键</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 修行不是消灭烦恼，而是认出“谁在觉知”</span></p><p><span>🎵本期BGM：</span></p><p><span>莫西子诗-《在四季里等待》</span></p><p><span>👋后期：</span></p><p><span>制作：文清</span></p><p><span>👨在哪里还可以看到主播</span></p><p><span>公众号：园长的多重宇宙</span></p><p><span>📹本节目在哪可听：</span></p><p><span>苹果播客｜小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜spotify&nbsp;</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
