  <item>
    <title>31.咨询师的自我修养</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a06943a1b7bd502952ff59b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a06943a1b7bd502952ff59b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，我是园长。今天想聊聊当朋友有烦恼向你请教时，你作为一个普通的咨询师，该怎么办？</span></p><p><span>✍️ shownotes</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 当朋友深陷情感陷阱，你帮他出主意，这也是菩提心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 第一条tips：心理问题没有进度条，千万不要着急</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> 你越努力，有可能把事情办得越糟糕？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="423">07:03</a> 也许一个哈根达斯，一周后就把问题解决了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a> 你的帮助只有15%来自道理，85%是神奇发生的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 第二条tips：给对方减负，而不是加码</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="918">15:18</a> 如果是特别焦虑朋友，我不建议他们去禅修</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 第三条：点到为止，种下解脱的种子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1483">24:43</a> 谁都不能替他悟道，谁都不能替他走出阴影</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a> 延伸育儿：父母做的很多都是无用功，有用的可能只需5分钟</span></p><p><span>🎵本期BGM：</span></p><p><span>Music by </span><a href="https://pixabay.com/users/leberch-42823964/?utm_source=link-attribution&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=music&amp;utm_content=254764" data-url="https://pixabay.com/users/leberch-42823964/?utm_source=link-attribution&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=music&amp;utm_content=254764"><u><span>Nikita Kondrashev</span></u></a><span> from </span><a href="https://pixabay.com//?utm_source=link-attribution&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=music&amp;utm_content=254764" data-url="https://pixabay.com//?utm_source=link-attribution&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=music&amp;utm_content=254764"><u><span>Pixabay</span></u></a></p><p><span>👋后期：</span></p><p><span>制作：文清</span></p><p><span>👨在哪里还可以看到主播</span></p><p><span>公众号：园长的多重宇宙</span></p><p><span>📹本节目在哪可听：</span></p><p><span>苹果播客｜小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜spotify&nbsp;</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
