  <item>
    <title>29.温柔而坚定，即是 The Middle Way</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d88045e2c8be3155d6f103</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d88045e2c8be3155d6f103</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 Apr 2026 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，我是园长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人让我聊聊与父母、孩子的关系，今天聊的内容也适用于谈判、谈生意，做管理……</span></p><span></span><p><span>✍️ shownotes</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a></span></strong><span> 这条原则不止管孩子：对老公、对父母、谈生意、管公司全通用</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">03:54</a></span></strong><span> 所有人际矛盾，本质只有两个问题：不够温柔，或不够坚定</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a></span></strong><span> 真实案例：孩子不想上钢琴课，怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a></span></strong><span> 用"相续"的概念看孩子：他过去500世经历的，一点不比你少</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="917">15:17</a></span></strong><span> 我的真实角色：不是家长，是比他个人高一点的朋友、大学室友</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1183">19:43</a></span></strong><span> 你存了10年的1万块全拿来打电话——你在浪费"家长"这个身份</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1285">21:25</a></span></strong><span> 严厉的角色让老师去演，我花钱请人扮黑脸，自己绝不上场</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a></span></strong><span> 教育只有两件事：兴趣和信心，其他全是多余</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">29:08</a></span></strong><span> "道理我都懂，可一见孩子就炸"——见地与修行是一枚硬币的两面</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a></span></strong><span> 一个终极锦囊</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>聲無哀樂SWAL-《飞升》</span></p><span></span><p><span>👋后期：</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：文清</span></p><span></span><p><span>👨在哪里还可以看到主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：园长的多重宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span>📹本节目在哪可听：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客｜小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜spotify</span></p>]]></description>
