  <item>
    <title>28.可以对着麦当劳佛皈依吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69cdf6d1b977fb2c47e7f098</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69cdf6d1b977fb2c47e7f098</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Apr 2026 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，我是园长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天想聊聊三个话题：皈依、弟子与上师的关系、灌顶。</span></p><span></span><p><span>✍️时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a></span></strong><span> 古代为什么要求先皈依再学佛？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a></span></strong><span> 手机屏保、奶茶佛、麦当劳佛竟然都能皈依？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a></span></strong><span> "皈依"的本质是"依靠"，从一把挡不住暴雨的伞说起</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a></span></strong><span> 最危险的皈依是皈依学历、好老公、造物主？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a></span></strong><span> 佛教到底要你皈依什么？三样不会欺骗你的东西</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a></span></strong><span> 内在三宝与外在三宝：你皈依的不是佛像</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="969">16:09</a></span></strong><span> 皈依僧≠见到出家人就磕头，现代社会多长个心眼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">21:35</a></span></strong><span> 你和老师的三种关系，决定修行的深度和风险</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a></span></strong><span> 金刚上师：用编程"变量交换"解释为什么需要一个中间人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1622">27:02</a></span></strong><span> 什么是密法？第三层佛法为什么"疯狂"又必须保密？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1913">31:53</a></span></strong><span> 灌顶从哪来？从印度王子的洗澡登基礼说起</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2182">36:22</a></span></strong><span> 圈内人反思：拼命追灌顶追密法，反而离觉醒越来越远</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2376">39:36</a></span></strong><span> 没灌顶不小心看了密法的书，怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Remi Wolf-《Cinderella》</span></p><span></span><p><span>👋后期：</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：文清</span></p><span></span><p><span>👨在哪里还可以看到主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：园长的多重宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span>📹本节目在哪可听：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客｜小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜spotify</span></p>]]></description>
